 "name_en": "Handover of Product Information to SAP Asset Intelligence Network (2WK)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Handover of Product Information to SAP Asset Intelligence Network (2WK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This business process enables a fast creation of the SAP Asset Intelligence Network model based on available product information by transferring this data from manufacturing to service. The Bill of Material serves as a basis for the transfer of the product data. SAP Asset Intelligence Network is one of the applications included in the SAP Leonardo Internet of Things (IoT) portfolio’s Connected Assets pillar. It is a secure cloud-based information exchange for equipment manufacturers, operators, and maintenance providers in asset-intensive industries.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Identify spare parts in the Manufacturing BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set the Manufacturing BOM as ready for handover</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Handover to Asset Intelligence Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Publish the model in SAP Asset Intelligence Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create new software version</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain the new software version in Manufacturing BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Handover the new software version to SAP Asset Intelligence Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Validate the software version change in SAP Asset Intelligence Network</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create asset structures out of already available product data in a fast, automated manner</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce master data maintenance efforts</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>移交产品信息至 SAP Asset Intelligence Network (2WK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过将数据从制造传输到服务，此业务流程支持基于可用产品信息快速创建 SAP Asset Intelligence Network 模型。物料清单用作产品数据传输的基础。SAP Asset Intelligence Network 是 SAP Leonardo Internet of Things (IoT) 产品组合的互联资产支柱中包含的应用程序之一。它是面向资产密集型行业设备制造商、运营商和维护提供商的基于云的安全信息交换。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">识别制造物料清单中的备件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将制造物料清单设置为移交准备就绪</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">移交至 SAP Asset Intelligence Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Asset Intelligence Network 中发布模型</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建新的软件版本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护制造物料清单中的新软件版本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">移交新的软件版本至 SAP Asset Intelligence Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">验证 SAP Asset Intelligence Network 中的软件版本更改</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio3676b71f5e794c498052c334047aee5c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">以快速、自动化的方式根据可用的产品数据创建资产结构</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少主数据维护工作量</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
